# Network Architecture

## Requirements

- Application must survive an Availability Zone failure.
- Application servers must not be directly accessible from the internet.
- Database must not be publicly accessible.
- Public users must access the web application over HTTPS.

## VPC

CIDR: 10.0.0.0/16

## Subnet Design

| Subnet | Availability Zone | CIDR | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| Public A | AZ-A | | Load balancer / NAT |
| Public B | AZ-B | | Load balancer / NAT |
| App A | AZ-A | | Application |
| App B | AZ-B | | Application |
| DB A | AZ-A | | Database |
| DB B | AZ-B | | Database |

